-- and the evasion as data: two claims of the same affinity, one molecule inside the class and one
-- outside it. This is what each generation of the unregulated supply is — isotonitazene against the
-- fentanyl class, the orphines against the nitazene class — and it is constructed, not assumed.
Evasion : BScope → Type 1
Evasion s = (b1 : BindClaim) × (b2 : BindClaim) × (bind-affinity b1 ≡ bind-affinity b2) × (s (bind-mol b1) ≡ true) × (s (bind-mol b2) ≡ false)
